### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 27.1 Remote Control WebSocket Bridge
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# WebSocket connection to bridge server for remote access
# Requires claude.ai subscription (login via /login)
#
# Production: wss://bridge.claudeusercontent.com
# Staging:    wss://bridge-staging.claudeusercontent.com
#
# Bridge constants:
#   MAX_LIFETIME: 86400000 (24h)
#   SESSION_TIMEOUT: 86400000 (24h)
#
# @name remoteControlBridge
# WebSocket: {{bridgeWsUrl}}
# Auth: Bearer token from claude.ai login


