### ============================================================================
### APPENDIX B: HEADERS REFERENCE
### ============================================================================
#
# Authentication:
#   Authorization: Bearer <access_token>    (OAuth)
#   x-api-key: <api_key>                    (API key)
#
# API Version:
#   anthropic-version: 2023-06-01
#   anthropic-beta: <beta-flags>
#
# Organization:
#   x-organization-uuid: <org_uuid>
#
# User-Agent formats:
#   claude-cli/{version} (external, cli)                  - for OAuth requests
#   claude-cli/{version} (external, cli, agent-sdk/x.y.z) - with SDK version
#   claude-code/{version}                                - for internal APIs
#
# Stainless SDK headers (auto-generated by SDK):
#   X-Stainless-Lang: js
#   X-Stainless-Package-Version: 0.74.0   (updated in v2.1.63)
#   X-Stainless-OS: Linux|MacOS|Windows|...
#   X-Stainless-Arch: x64|arm64|...
#   X-Stainless-Runtime: node|deno|edge|browser:...
#   X-Stainless-Runtime-Version: v22.0.0
#   X-Stainless-Helper-Method: stream (for streaming)
#
# Content:
#   Content-Type: application/json
#   Accept: application/binary (for file downloads)
#
# Caching:
#   Cache-Control: no-cache (for health checks)
#
# Rate Limiting (NEW in v2.1.63 - unified rate limit headers):
#   anthropic-ratelimit-unified-status
#   anthropic-ratelimit-unified-reset
#   anthropic-ratelimit-unified-fallback
#   anthropic-ratelimit-unified-overage-status
#   anthropic-ratelimit-unified-overage-reset
#   anthropic-ratelimit-unified-overage-disabled-reason
#   anthropic-ratelimit-unified-representative-claim
#
# Marketplace/Plugins (NEW in v2.1.63):
#   anthropic-marketplace
#   anthropic-plugins
#   anthropic-dangerous-direct-browser-access


