### ============================================================================
### SECTION 43: OBSERVED TRAFFIC (v2.1.234, live session)
### ============================================================================
#
# WORKFLOW.md's rule stands: endpoints are never *inferred* from runtime logs.
# This section does the opposite -- it takes endpoints already verified in the
# binary and records what a real v2.1.234 session actually sent, so the header
# sets above can be checked against the wire rather than trusted.
#
# Captured from a local MITM trace of one interactive session. No identifiers,
# tokens, request-ids or organization UUIDs from that capture are reproduced.
#
# Two User-Agents are in play, and they map exactly to the two client shapes:
#   claude-cli/2.1.234 (external, cli)   axios call sites
#   claude-code/2.1.234                  Stainless SDK client
#
# | Method | Path                              | Auth headers seen                         |
# |--------|-----------------------------------|-------------------------------------------|
# | GET    | /api/oauth/profile                | authorization, anthropic-beta: oauth-*    |
# | GET    | /api/oauth/usage                  | authorization, anthropic-beta: oauth-*    |
# | GET    | /api/oauth/account/settings       | authorization, anthropic-beta: oauth-*    |
# | GET    | /api/claude_code_grove            | authorization, anthropic-beta: oauth-*    |
# | GET    | /api/claude_code_penguin_mode     | authorization, anthropic-beta: oauth-*    |
# | GET    | /api/claude_cli/bootstrap         | authorization, anthropic-beta: oauth-*    |
# | POST   | /api/event_logging/v2/batch       | + x-service-name                          |
# | POST   | /api/eval/{clientKey}             | authorization, anthropic-beta: oauth-*    |
# | GET    | /mcp-registry/v0/servers          | none (no authorization header)            |
# | GET    | /v1/mcp_servers?limit=1000        | + anthropic-mcp-client-capabilities,      |
# |        |                                   |   mcp-protocol-version                    |
# | GET    | /v1/code/triggers                 | teleport-org set (see below)              |
# | GET    | /v1/ultrareview/quota             | teleport-org set (see below)              |
# | POST   | /v1/messages?beta=true            | full SDK set (see below)                  |
#
# CONFIRMS the auth-mode table in the file header:
#
#   /v1/code/triggers and /v1/ultrareview/quota both went out with exactly
#   authorization + content-type + anthropic-version + anthropic-client-platform
#   + x-organization-uuid -- the "teleport-org" set, matching
#   `auth: "teleport-org"` at both call sites. `/v1/code/triggers` additionally
#   carried anthropic-beta: ccr-triggers-2026-01-30.
#
#   The /api/oauth/* calls went out with authorization + anthropic-beta:
#   oauth-2025-04-20 and no organization header -- the default OAuth set.
#
# /api/claude_cli/bootstrap carries the selected model in the query string:
#
### GET /api/claude_cli/bootstrap
# source=axios  timeout=5000ms  observed live
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/claude_cli/bootstrap?entrypoint=cli&model=claude-opus-5
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
anthropic-beta: {{oauthBeta}}
Content-Type: application/json
User-Agent: claude-cli/{{cliVersion}} (external, cli)

### Event logging batch (highest-volume endpoint in a session)
# source=axios  observed live: 132 calls in one session, all 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/event_logging/v2/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
anthropic-beta: {{oauthBeta}}
Content-Type: application/json
x-service-name: claude_code
User-Agent: claude-cli/{{cliVersion}} (external, cli)

### MCP registry listing (unauthenticated, cursor-paginated)
# source=axios  auth="none"  timeout=5000ms  observed live
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp-registry/v0/servers?version=latest&limit=100&visibility=commercial,gsuite,enterprise,health
Accept: application/json
User-Agent: claude-cli/{{cliVersion}} (external, cli)

# Pagination: the response carries a cursor which is passed back as
# &cursor=<server-name>:<version>.

### Ultrareview quota
# source=axios  auth="teleport-org"  timeout=3000ms  observed live
# CLAUDE_CODE_ULTRAREVIEW_QUOTA_FIXTURE, when set, is parsed as JSON and
# returned instead -- no request is made.
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/ultrareview/quota
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
anthropic-version: {{version}}
anthropic-client-platform: {{clientPlatform}}
x-organization-uuid: {{orgUuid}}
User-Agent: claude-cli/{{cliVersion}} (external, cli)

